OL,3,GNEWSAKilian, Jade and Miriam - meet the
OL,4,Apeople sharing their names with storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FAusten, Boelo and Chloe will be the
OL,7,Ffirst three names used for storms which
OL,8,Fcould affect the UK, Ireland and the
OL,9,FNetherlands during the new storm
OL,10,Fseason.
OL,12,FThe list of 21 names has been announced
OL,13,Fby the Met Office, Met Eireann and the
OL,14,FDutch national weather service, KNMI,
OL,15,Fand comes into effect on 1 September
OL,16,Fand runs until 31st August 2027.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
