OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKilian, Jade and Miriam - meet the
OL,4,Apeople sharing their names with storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther names which could feature in
OL,7,Fweather forecasts over the coming year
OL,8,Finclude Kilian, Jade, Miriam, Finn and
OL,9,FNicola - while one of Britain's
OL,10,Fbest-known animated characters has also
OL,11,Fmade the cut.
OL,13,FShaun, after Shaun the Sheep, was
OL,14,Fchosen following a public vote which
OL,15,Fpitted him against fellow character
OL,16,FTimmy.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
